    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Shopping in shops",
     "texto": [
      "The typical phrase from the shop assistant is «Goedemiddag. Kan ik u helpen?» (Good afternoon, can I help you?). To say what you are looking for: «Ik zoek...» (I am looking for...). The verb «mogen» (may) expresses permission: «Mag ik pinnen?» (May I pay by card?). Shopping words: «de winkel» (the shop), «het geld» (the money), «de bon» (the receipt), «de pinpas» (the debit card)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
